@AngeCafe_HostAddress = https://localhost:7293

### Get all categories
GET {{AngeCafe_HostAddress}}/api/Category
Accept: application/json

### Get all menu items
GET {{AngeCafe_HostAddress}}/api/MenuItem
Accept: application/json

### Get order by queue number
GET {{AngeCafe_HostAddress}}/api/Order/AC-20261120-0001
Accept: application/json
